I found it.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:06.510
I found it.
I found it.

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.450
Wow!

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:09.920
Lillies?

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:11.860
