No way!

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.600
What?! You're so mean!

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.770
I'm coming in.

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.010
Go right ahead.

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.480
Kishi!

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.440
I came over again.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.080
I have this for you today.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.680
What's this?

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.120
A showing? Yours?

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.450
That's amazing!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.460
It's just a small hall, but if you'd like...

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:50.300
Thank you! Then, you can have one of mine.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.990
Yoshinoya

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.330
Please come to see it!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.500
Thanks...

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:08.040
I wonder how Miya-chan is getting along?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:11.080
Don't go too far ahead of me.

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.550
No! I want you to make progress!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.820
I don't mind if you're getting along!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:19.390
Yamabuki Festival
Entrance

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:23.560
Yamabuki Festival
Entrance
But it seems like I'm the only
one getting left behind.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.660
Could you make it a little brighter?

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:31.900
Could you change the angle
of the reflective panel?

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:35.210
I see, some people are making films.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.180
Oh, sorry.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.470
Don't worry, we didn't film that.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:44.950
Her knee popped.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.750
Her knee popped really loudly.

00:17:50.220 --> 00:17:56.990
Speaking of films, Kishi is probably
making videos somewhere right now.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:01.070
I think anything I encounter
can be starting point.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:07.530
Once you realize that fact, you'll be able to
pick out the important parts of many things.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.940
I just haven't realized it.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:14.270
The important parts are already close to me?

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.560
Oh, Yuno, what's wrong?

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:35.200
Clap!

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.040
Thank you!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.030
Y-You're welcome?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.070
Nothing good ever happens.

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.310
Cigarettes keep getting more expensive too.

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:48.580
All right, I'm going to quit!

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.350
Maybe just one more...

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:33.930
Received Messages
1 Message

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:34.430
Hiro
Hiro
No Subject

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:36.090
Hiro
No Subject
Dinner's Ready

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.660
Wow!

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.030
Saury!

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:46.140
Today seems to be fine.

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:48.240
It doesn't look like the landlady
is going to come around.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:52.270
The last time she ran off with your saury.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.010
Then, let's eat it quickly, while it's still hot.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:58.450
Let's dig in!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.250
Let's eat!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.020
Delicious!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.290
There's a lot of oil on it.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:09.160
I'm glad I got to eat it.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:12.330
Miyako, don't talk with your mouth full.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:15.170
That aside, the landlady sure has it tough.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.600
So it seems.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:19.360
She takes on all sorts of part-time jobs.

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.800
Isn't that a hobby of hers?

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:24.240
Well...

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.800
Could I have seconds?

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:28.580
Okay!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:32.570
Eat up. The Yamabuki Festival
is only a little while away.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:34.550
Okay!

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:38.050
Yuno, are things looking good?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.950
Yes, I just have to give it my best!

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:45.420
I'm glad. I finally found
something I want to make.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:50.230
I was thinking of drawing everyone
preparing for the Yamabuki Festival.

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.840
Oh?

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:54.540
What about you, Miya-chan?
What are you making?

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.100
It's still a secret.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:58.330
What?

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.680
I'm still worried about my lines.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.410
I just can't let go of my script.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.520
In order to get rid of your worries,
all you can do is practice.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.690
I'll help you out anytime.

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:09.210
Thank you, all that's left are our costumes.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.680
We've got to do something about that.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.220
Only three days left, huh?

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.880
Only two days left.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.690
I'm looking forward to it.

00:21:17.930 --> 00:21:19.360
Let's all do our best.

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:20.570
Of course!

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.470
I'm barely going to make it.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:35.500
But I'm going to try my best.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.620
I'm going to try my best.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:48.430
No!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:49.790
I'm going to try my best.

